Marks in this directory
=======================

Most of the SVG files here are copied from the simple-icons project
(https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons), version 16.28.0, which publishes
them under the CC0-1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). Each file is the icon's
single path placed in a 24x24 viewBox with fill="currentColor"; titles were
stripped. index.mjs is generated from the same package and inlines the same
bytes as data URIs because the panel's Content-Security-Policy forbids remote
images.

Seventeen marks that simple-icons does not carry (canva, apify, context7,
semgrep, globalping, heroku, exa, amplitude, close, attio, plaid, klaviyo,
readwise, honeycomb, stytch, workos, polar) were taken from the vendor's own
brand kit, favicon or GitHub avatar on 2026-08-23; SOURCES.md in this directory
records the URL, format, stated terms and fetch date for each. They are not
CC0: they are the vendor's trademark, held here under the nominative-use
rationale below, and nothing more.

The marks are trademarks of their respective owners. They are shown here only
to identify a connection to the vendor's own service (nominative use) and imply
no sponsorship, affiliation or endorsement of Crads AI by any of those vendors.
A vendor's own brand guidelines govern any use beyond identifying the
connection.
